{
  "title": "LAMMPSKit",
  "upload_type": "software",
  "description": "<p>A Python toolkit for post-processing and analysing molecular-dynamics simulations run with LAMMPS, built for simulations of HfTaO-based ReRAM devices. It tracks filament formation and evolution with OVITO-based cluster analysis, analyses atomic, charge and displacement distributions, and produces publication-ready plots.</p>",
